# --- Native pdfium library ----------------------------------------------
# `oct-scan` counts pages with pdfium (see spike/parser/FINDINGS.md for the measured
# comparison). The library is ~8 MB of platform-specific binary, so it is fetched
# rather than committed:  scripts/fetch-pdfium.sh
vendor/pdfium/

# --- R12 spike artifacts -------------------------------------------------
# The spike harness sources (runner.mjs, server.mjs, public/*.html|*.js)
# and its measured results (FINDINGS.md, results.json, results.raw.jsonl)
# ARE committed as evidence. The following are regenerable or user-specific:
#
#   vendor/      ~44 MB of pdf.js, restored with `npm pack pdfjs-dist`
#   public/pdf/  symlinks into the maintainer's personal Documents tree
#   logs/        browser profiles and per-run scratch
spike/r12/vendor/
spike/r12/public/pdf/
spike/r12/logs/

# --- T6 parser spike artifacts -------------------------------------------
# The harness sources (main.rs, run.py, Cargo.toml), the measured results
# (results.json, FINDINGS.md) and the pdfium licence notice ARE committed as
# evidence. The following are regenerable or heavy:
#
#   vendor/   ~8 MB libpdfium.so, restored from bblanchon/pdfium-binaries
#   target/   cargo build output
spike/parser/vendor/
spike/parser/target/
